The  driver  provides support for USB modems in the Communication
Device Class using the Abstract Control Model.  These modems  are
basically  standard serial line modems, but they are accessed via
USB instead.  They support a regular AT command  set.   The  com‐
mands  can  either be multiplexed with the data stream or handled
through separate pipes.  In the latter case the AT commands  have
